# KONTROLL — HERO SECTION REDESIGN 2026/2027
## Underground Club Culture × Industrial Chrome × Hypnotic Audio Visualization

### 1. YOUR MISSION

Redesign the entire existing KONTROLL Live hero section.

Do not build a completely different website. Work within the existing KONTROLL visual identity and improve the current hero section by introducing a clear visual hierarchy, removing redundant controls, refining the information architecture, and creating a powerful underground club atmosphere.

The current hero section feels cluttered, repetitive, and insufficiently structured. Too many controls compete for attention, and several functions are duplicated.

We want to transform it into a distinctive, immersive, premium underground radio experience that feels authentic to electronic music culture while remaining technologically advanced and visually relevant for 2026/2027.

The result must feel like a hybrid of:

- An underground Berlin techno radio station.
- A vintage industrial mixing console.
- A high-end digital audio visualization system.
- A raw, metallic, chrome-inspired club interface.
- A contemporary electronic music broadcast platform.

**Core principle: Less interface. More atmosphere. More movement. More identity.**

Do not add unnecessary features. Every element must have a clear purpose.

---

### 2. THE THREE CORE ELEMENTS

The hero section must be built around three primary visual elements, arranged in this order:

1. LIVE TICKER — the live information layer.
2. HYPNOTIC EQUALIZER — the primary visual centerpiece.
3. DISPATCH FEED — the live community layer.

A single, clearly positioned stream call-to-action sits below these elements.

These components must feel like one coherent broadcast system rather than separate widgets stacked together.

The equalizer is the main visual attraction. The ticker establishes the live context, while the dispatch feed communicates the energy of the community.

The interface must be immediately understandable without instructions.

